  {
   "op": "note",
   "text": "Path: from a new game the player kills seven people before taking their quests; each OnDeath block fails the quests that hang on them [observed, decompiled scripts]. Marcus (JacobstownMarcusScript, the player the killer, Jacobstown not hostile): VMS24, VMS41, VMS50 and VMS54 110. Michael Angelo (VMS22MichaelAngeloScript, VMS22 below 70): VMS22 80, whose stage script fails it at 100. James Garret (VFSJamesGarretSCRIPT): VFSAtomicPimp 0. Joana (VMS21aJoanaSCRIPT, VMS21a below 5): VMS21a 150, whose stage script sets 160. Walter Phebus (VMS25WalterSCRIPT, VMS25 below 5 and not completed): VMS25 100. Crandon (VOVCrandonScript, VDialogueVegasNorth below 29): 29; then Jules (JulesScript, objective 40 not completed): 110. Crandon goes before Jules, since 110 lifts the stage past 29. Joana's and Walter's other branches (Carlitos 170, Ethel 110) are exclusive with these and are in fail-killed-givers-2."
  },
  {
   "op": "note",
   "text": "Stand-ins: travel by move_player to each person; each fight by kill with the player as killer (the OnDeath blocks named run as in play). Walter Phebus is enabled by hand, standing in for the Strip's street event script (VStreetEventStarterScript), which enables him while the player is on the Strip (as pheeble-will does)."
  },
